felt-board-design

This distribution contains software derived from DaVinci:
https://github.com/ChrisZou/davinci
Original license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE and editor/LICENSE).
Original project documentation is retained in editor/README.md.

Changes in this distribution include the blackboard-design skill and eight-style
prompt catalog, Lemon image CLI adapter, physical-size A3/A4 printing and packing,
editable print boards and project packages, bulk print selection/removal,
a website interface without brand logo, and startup that tolerates failure of
the optional macOS native cutout helper.

The imported DaVinci source was a local source snapshot; an exact upstream commit
was not recorded. No claim is made that this is an official DaVinci release.
Third-party dependencies remain subject to their respective licenses.
